Q.resources -= 2;
Q.kwasniewski_standing += 3;
Q.kwasniewski_alignment_bias += 8;
Q.sld_populist_international_isolation = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.sld_populist_international_isolation) || 0) - 14
);
Q.sld_populist_factional_capture = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.sld_populist_factional_capture) || 0) - 8
);
Q.sld_populist_media_salience = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.sld_populist_media_salience) || 0) - 6
);
Q.progressive_credibility += 6;
Q.urban_progressive_support += 3;
Q.public_trust += 3;
Q.ko_relation += 4;
Q.institutional_trust += 2;
Q.progressives_dissent -= 6;
Q.razem_dissent -= 4;
Q.rural_support -= 3;
Q.social_patriot_dissent += 8;
Q.party_unity -= 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "The refoundation is publicly walked back after a former president's intervention";
!}

Miller does not apologise, because Miller has never apologised for anything. He
does something more useful: he lets a joint statement go out restating the
European commitment, the constitutional commitment and a guarantee that no
current will be expelled for opposing the new line.

The county organisers who were promised a party that had finally stopped
listening to Warsaw read the statement and understand exactly what it is. The
transformation continues, with one hand tied and a former president's fingerprints
visible on the knot.

- @poland_event_queue: Publish the joint statement

@road_sign_decline
title: Tell him, politely, that the party he is describing no longer exists
subtitle: Free. No reversal, no insult; a straightforward generational refusal that the old electorate hears clearly.
on-arrival: {!
Q.kwasniewski_standing -= 2;
Q.kwasniewski_alignment_bias -= 6;
Q.kwasniewski_reproach_debt += 1;
Q.urban_progressive_support -= 3;
Q.pensioner_support -= 2;
Q.public_trust -= 2;
Q.ko_relation -= 4;
Q.progressive_credibility -= 2;
Q.party_unity += 2;
Q.social_patriot_dissent -= 4;
Q.rural_support += 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "The Left tells a former president that the party he built is not the party he is describing";
!}

The answer is courteous and completely unambiguous. We tell him that the
organisation he is worried about stopped existing somewhere between the pension
reform and the second Iraq deployment, that the people we now represent were not
consulted about either, and that we are not going to run a campaign designed to
reassure the readers of the newspapers he gives interviews to.

He accepts the answer without heat, which is how we learn it was serious. The
old SLD electorate and the urban social democrats hear a party telling its own
founder that he is behind the times, and a fraction of them quietly conclude
that he is not.

- @poland_event_queue: Give the polite answer

@road_sign_break
title: Say that the salon of the Third Republic has no authority over a working-class left
subtitle: Helps the transformation and ends him. Permanently removes Kwaśniewski, the Belka-era establishment and a slice of urban social-democratic support from the project.
on-arrival: {!
Q.kwasniewski_estranged = 1;
Q.kwasniewski_channel = 0;
Q.kwasniewski_standing = 0;
Q.kwasniewski_alignment_bias -= 25;
Q.kwasniewski_verdict =
    "Broke with the party permanently over the social-populist refoundation";
Q.sld_populist_factional_capture += 12;
Q.sld_populist_media_salience += 14;
Q.sld_populist_international_isolation += 16;
Q.rural_support += 6;
Q.workers_support += 3;
Q.anti_establishment_youth_left_affinity += 5;
Q.social_patriot_support += 5;
Q.social_patriot_dissent -= 6;
Q.urban_progressive_support -= 7;
Q.pensioner_support -= 3;
Q.progressive_credibility -= 6;
Q.public_trust -= 4;
Q.institutional_trust -= 3;
Q.ko_relation -= 8;
Q.p2050_relation -= 4;
Q.eu_left_network -= 6;
Q.progressives_dissent += 5;
Q.razem_dissent += 5;
Q.news_headline =
    "Kwaśniewski is told he has no authority over the new left, and stops speaking to it";
!}

Miller says it on camera and enjoys saying it. The salon of the Third Republic —
the presidents, the ambassadors, the foundation boards, the men who divided this
country's assets among themselves and then lectured its workers about
competitiveness for thirty years — does not have jurisdiction over a party that
belongs to the people they left behind.

It is the best day the transformation has had. The clip runs everywhere, the
county committees are exuberant, and in the towns the campaign was built for it
lands as the truth.

It also ends something. Kwaśniewski does not reply, then or later. Neither do
the ambassadors, the European foundations or the people who used to make a
telephone call on our behalf when a door needed opening. The urban social
democrats who stayed through the refoundation because the old president had not
condemned it leave in the fortnight after he does.

The road sign is behind us now, and it was the last one.

- @poland_event_queue: Leave the normal left
